# OpenAPI contract package is published to GitHub Packages.
# Installing it needs a token in NODE_AUTH_TOKEN with read:packages access for
# the dauphaihau-camille account. Never commit the token itself.
@dauphaihau-camille:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
# Provide the token via the environment (or your user-level ~/.npmrc):
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
